cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "HodgeCY: A Computational Hodge and Calabi--Yau Data System"
message: "If you use HodgeCY v1.0.0, please cite the software release and acknowledge the external source datasets used for your analysis."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rahman
    given-names: Abdul
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-22"
repository-code: "https://github.com/geocy-labs/hodgecy"
license: MIT
abstract: "HodgeCY v1.0.0 is the first comprehensive HodgeCY data-system release, providing source-aware Calabi--Yau and Hodge-theoretic corpus infrastructure, typed schemas, query/catalog support, provenance and checksum tracking, relationship infrastructure, exact algebra utilities, certificate support, and HodgeCY I reproducibility assets. The v1.0.0 Zenodo DOI has not yet been minted."
